      "general": {
        "abstract": "The Climate-Ecological Observatory for Arctic Tundra (COAT) platform covers two sites in the Norwegian terrestrial arctic - low-arctic Varanger Peninsula and high-arctic Svalbard. Long-term monitoring and research on tundra ecosystems are conducted on these sites. ",
